  "title": "Microwave Peanut Patties",
  "description": "These are kind of like peanut brittle cookies! Sugar, corn syrup, butter, vanilla extract and red food coloring are microwaved with peanuts to make these simple, no bake cookies.",
  "authors": [
    "m-ann"
  ],
